{"step_index":604,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:21:54Z","thinking":"Begin by categorizing the 132 entities to focus data collection. Prioritize separating the investigation targets into distinct groups. Establish \"Group A\" as large chains/franchises and media outlets with ~10 companies listed as the first group. Initial data gathering involves listing each identified entity for targeted investigation.\n\n\nNow, expanding the initial group listing, analyzing the listed entities shows they belong in either a 'Retail & Media' group or a 'Technology & Content' group based on business type and location.  Considering the addresses and descriptions, it's possible to create \"Group B\" representing businesses within the Busan Cultural Content Complex or similar technology hubs. This categorization aids in prioritizing research based on likely industry connections.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"\\\"피커스튜디오\\\" \\\"이현철\\\"\"","toolAction":"\"Searching 피커스튜디오\"","toolSummary":"\"Search 피커스튜디오\""}}]}
{"step_index":605,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:21:54Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-21T09:21:54+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-21T09:21:57+09:00\nThe search for \"\"피커스튜디오\" \"이현철\"\" returned the following summary:\n**피커스튜디오(Picker Studio)**는 증강현실(AR) 및 가상현실(VR) 콘텐츠를 개발하는 기업으로, **이현철** 대표가 이끌고 있습니다[1][2][3].\n\n### 주요 정보\n*   **대표자:** 이현철[2][4][5]\n*   **주요 사업:** 증강/가상현실 콘텐츠 개발, 교육용 완구 및 스마트 놀이 교재 제작[2][3][6]\n*   **주요 제품 및 서비스:**\n    *   **증강현실 곤충 시리즈:** '증강현실 곤충 종이접기', '증강현실 곤충퍼즐' 등 오프라인 제품과 모바일 앱을 연동한 교육 콘텐츠[2][7][8]\n    *   **기능성 게임 및 앱:** 2014년 출시한 아동용 기능성 게임 '도와줘! 신데렐라'를 비롯해 웨어러블 스포츠 게임, 가상 증강현실 블록 놀이 앱 등을 개발[2][9][6]\n*   **특징:** ICT 기술을 활용해 독창적인 재미와 놀이를 제공하며, 비대면 교육 시장에 대응하는 체감형 학습 콘텐츠에 주력하고 있습니다[2][9][6].\n\n피커스튜디오는 부산에 소재하고 있으며[10][4][11], 관련 체험 행사나 전시회(예: AI KOREA, 교육 박람회 등)를 통해 꾸준히 활동하고 있습니다[2][12][7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQElb82XJq4cRpg--MJE5LUzFYZXtCtGK3AL3ICh0Vq9XLMeDDtL54-xfrxNbi4mCB2zOpIgvxlRkmtwQGMG_hyfv40d0fzxjlrdmjyfgYCW7U-60As4AXUg7Hh9tesGK2ljzOP2Dw==)\n[2] [ictweek.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHomrKoqBb7FEvrdbg-7neldKO38F7uHNvuqcnF-AZJo95YWnEcNQRCuvldGgB-EKle14moMfHEieAaVx0ovMPhO_92c8lgZ53aEdB7C2npwlxe9oeersNnWnogjH9Xt3IjHO_4iQo91ETv8saV8fKZQzbJoGRTq97RcMRpqNa5IX8YH2Wr6oHcL6bL6I5-TUGPaOM-)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGyaR6SkkjRxdHR3dawf2vzNzxZxBv9fy7eIRLI_HhcqY_hW0_TyOcbEMs3MpfwqELhPwy1K_fNhMZnSjJ5aOn8V_AAUEg3CL\n<truncated 255 bytes>\nob.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGe-rIqmuDTNylei-FWmBbrjoigb3neYZbRrGYU5ZQihHHgxvnGM3qPD3uc09IW7JJURmbd9TrPu9P3Uxv-kG6x1UHgyU3tB_PYpsgWpmbAR_ZgZ-5xD-8UrHXC1QoFsjrF_xmPpkvfyw==)\n[6] [google.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGvEsXo5z_EECv0K0CR_vXuloHMBlbxumrJsvOfAtEAwY9iPXs8BNdr_z_vLU9Ix1oOZwbn7EnNvM